  "reason": "Evidence: scvi_n200 + imagenet_vit_l + transformer + weighted (config_003) is the current best at 0.725 acc, and all tested multiprofile scvi_n200 variants cluster around 0.71–0.725, suggesting we are near the ceiling of the multiprofile architecture. The singleprofile setting (aggregation=None) has never been tested with the top-performing encoders (scvi_n200 + imagenet_vit_l). This experiment tests whether the singleprofile architecture, which bypasses the transformer/avgpool aggregation step, can either match or exceed the multiprofile best by handling the two modalities differently. Choosing weighted fusion (config_051) over concat is supported by the consistent (if small) edge of weighted over concat in multiprofile (0.725 vs 0.721). With only 2 experiments remaining, this is the highest-information test: if singleprofile beats 0.725, we find a new best; if it doesn't, we confirm multiprofile is optimal and can spend the final experiment on a minor multiprofile refinement rather than chasing a dead end."
}

